   455	    #
   456	    # CF-3 ASYMMETRY (stated in BOTH rails, where it can be acted on): the
   457	    # server-side twin (.github/scripts/validate-pair-rail-verdict.py, step
   458	    # 15) carries `continue-on-error` when CEO_PAIR_RAIL_VERDICT_OPTIONAL=1
   459	    # (release.yml:689) -- there the decision check is defence in depth.
   460	    # THIS is the rail that enforces in every mode: release.sh calls it with
   461	    # `|| die`, and the release.yml step that calls it carries no escape
   462	    # hatch. Neither may be dropped for the other.
   463	    #
